        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "From samurai swords to crystal ball manipulation, this family-friendly performance combines skill with cultural exchange. All the Way From Japan blends traditional Japanese artistry with modern circus skills, in a dynamic fusion of Edo Daikagura—an over 400-year-old performance tradition—alongside cutting-edge juggling and comedic audience interaction."
