    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tINTERNATIONAL GUITAR NIGHT\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tJanuary 27, 2027 @ 7:30 pm - 9:30 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-\n\t\t\t\t\t\t$10 – $45\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSince 1995, Brian Gore has been bringing together four international luminaries of acoustic guitar to create sell-out tours—and this season, International Guitar Night arrives at ArtSpring. This year’s musicians are Itamar Erez, a globally recognized composer and guitarist whose music blends the delicacy of Middle Eastern melodies, the passion of flamenco, and the freedom of jazz; Victoria Ruiz de la Rubia, a fiery and technically masterful classical guitarist from Spain; Cenk Erdoğan, a fretless guitar pioneer, jazz artist and award-winning composer, whose work represents a uniquely Turkish approach to the instrument; and Remi Harris—one of the UK’s most successful jazz guitarists, renowned for combining Gypsy jazz with rock, pop, and blues.\nThank you to Guitars Plus of Victoria for sponsoring this performance.\nWed Jan 27 | 7:30pm | Adult $45, Youth, $10\nTickets available:\nFor members, in person only: Tue Sept 1, 10am-4pm\nFor member, online, by phone and in person: Wed Sept 2, from 10am\nGeneral sales, online, by phone and in person: Tue Sept 8, 10am\nBUY TICKETS\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t January 27, 2027 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t7:30 pm - 9:30 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tCost:\n\t\t\t\t $10 – $45 \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: ArtSpring Presents 2026-27, ASP-slider\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tArtSpring\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t