    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Due to popular demand, we’re delighted to welcome back PIQSIQ to ArtSpring. With a style perpetually galvanized by darkness and haunting northern beauty, sisters Tiffany Ayalik and Inuksuk Mackay come [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
