        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;&nbsp; King, Cash, and Diamond Forever is a high-energy tribute show coming to ArtSpring Theatre this September, celebrating three legendary icons of music—Johnny Cash, Elvis Presley, and Neil Diamond. Multi-award-winning [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
