        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;SUN FEB 8, 2:30pm | Led by powerhouse vocalist and dancer Tamar Ilana, Ventanas is a vibrant six-piece world music ensemble that weaves together flamenco, Sephardic, Balkan, and original music [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
