    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;FRI July 18, 7:30pm | The Victoria Times-Colonist called Zachary a “dead ringer for dead singers” for his uncanny ability to replicate the sound and personalities of legendary musicians on [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
